'''Power in Numbers''' (数の暴力, ''Kazu no Bōryoku'', '''Strength in Numbers''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 7.4 Update|Version 7.4]].

==Effect==
"Weaken" Effect UP (Sm): Weaken duration increases by 10%.

